# Retorno (Borza, Rayuela Jam 2019, Spanish): full run to the good ending (all ten photo memories, safe unlocked but left shut). Seed 1234, no clock.
# Dream cycle: lie on the double bed, `levantar almohadas`, take the old photo, `dejar foto <next>`, `dormir`, `despertar`; the Ask on the first dreamt photo needs `coger foto museo` first so the pillow is usable.
# Order matters: HUERTA dream (peces guardian) -> pez key -> padlocked tool drawer -> pala; ARBOL dream (pala cavar) -> shoebox in the patio -> LIVING photo (wash in the bucket, dry with the fan); LIVING dream (loose floor board + music box compartment) -> safe key and small key -> metal box -> VIAJE photo.
